## GitHub Profile Viewer

### description
A sleek, responsive web application to search and explore GitHub profiles.
Easily view user information, repositories, and GitHub stats in a clean and intuitive interface. Perfect for developers, recruiters, and GitHub enthusiasts.

 # Features

Search GitHub Users by username.

View Profile Details: profile picture, bio, location, followers, following, and public repositories.

Explore Repositories: repository name, description, stars, forks, and direct GitHub links.

Responsive Design: works on desktop, tablet, and mobile.

Dark/Light Mode toggle (optional).

Error Handling: handles invalid usernames and API errors gracefully.

 Technologies Used

Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript

API: GitHub REST API

Deployment: GitHub Pages

